# Force LF line endings on checkout regardless of platform or a
# contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a Windows checkout
# converts every text file to CRLF, and gofmt (which always emits LF)
# then reports the entire file as unformatted -- not a real formatting
# problem, just a line-ending mismatch. Repository blobs are already LF;
# this only controls checkout/commit conversion, so no files need
# renormalizing.
* text=auto eol=lf
